  "details": "When I start Steam VR and the controllers, then load VRChat (Selecting VR mode), the little blue swirly select icon that appears in Desktop Mode appears in the middle of my HTC Vive headset.  The game want's to primarily listen to that for input instead of the controllers.  The character is also stuck running full forward and full left and the in game menu is inaccessible.\nThe only way for the game to work properly is if I load the game from Steam first without starting Steam VR first and then immediately turn on the controllers.",
